        'A slab panel is 4 m by 6 m. Its span ratio is 6/4=1.5, which is less than 2, so it is designed as two-way spanning in both directions with moment coefficients for the panel. Had the ratio been 2.5, it would be designed as one-way spanning in the short direction.',
