        'A crop has a base period B=120 days and a duty D=1200 ha per cumec. Its delta is Δ=8.64×120/1200=0.864 m of water over the season, so a 1200-hectare crop needs 1 cumec of canal discharge over that base period.',
        'Use the same units throughout (days, hectares per cumec, metres of depth) and state the base period clearly; the 8.64 factor depends on these units.',
